<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93629" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σελευκ-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, a kind of <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>woman's shoe from Seleucia</i> in Syria, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.94
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>a drinking-cup, so named after Seleucus</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Polem.Hist.
				57
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Délos</u>
				443
			</span></i>
			<i>B b</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				72
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Aem.</u>
				33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τριήρης</span>, a kind of
			<i>ship</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pomp.</u>
				77
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> the realm of
			Seleucus, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				219.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				229.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				16.2.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			Adj. of part of Cappadocia, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κ. τῆς Σελευκίδος λεγομένης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>Syr.</u>
					55
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			<i>a bird which eats locusts</i>, the <i>Rose-coloured Pastor,
				Pastor roseus</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				10.75
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.397
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				17.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Zos.
				1.56.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
